Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.76,0:02:03.58,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&999944&\blur4}對輕咬示好的小貓們
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.56,0:02:09.40,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&7744CB&\blur4}哄一哄 我們由此相視而笑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.88,0:02:15.57,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&55BA79&\blur4}如果我們永遠如此
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.75,0:02:18.60,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&278BD3&\blur4}該是多麼平靜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.60,0:02:21.12,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&278BD3&\blur4}可是愛意襲來
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.16,0:02:24.93,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4}催人越發急躁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.72,0:02:27.70,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\3c&999944&\blur4}「要選誰呢？」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.70,0:02:28.20,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,120)\3c&2222CC&\blur4}「要選誰呢？」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.55,0:02:31.00,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&2222CC&\blur4}就選你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.50,0:02:33.71,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\3c&773333&\blur4}「選誰都行？」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.71,0:02:34.00,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,120)\3c&999944&\blur4}「選誰都行？」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.42,0:02:36.72,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&443333&\blur4}就非你不可！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.72,0:02:39.26,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\3c&A777CA&\fad(120,120)\an9\t(400,700,\3c&999944&)}如果可以的話
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.53,0:02:41.92,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\an9\blur4\3c&A777CA&}能像小貓輕咬般你儂我儂
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.11,0:02:46.96,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\an9\3c&A777CA&\blur4}這麼直到永遠就好了
