Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.18,0:02:53.51,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&A9A954&\blur4\t(300,2000,\3c&C777C3&)}心痛是在所難免的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.65,0:02:54.86,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\3c&D777C3&\blur4\t(300,1200,\3c&579BE3&)}更不用說會傷害到彼此
